    "zh": "本課學習目標",
    "body": "<p class=\"lead\">By the end of this lesson, you will be able to:</p><ul><li><b>Locate mixed methods</b> within the wider methods landscape and explain why a problem needs both kinds of evidence.</li><li><b>Choose and diagram</b> a convergent, explanatory sequential, or exploratory sequential design.</li><li><b>Justify sampling</b> choices, sample relationships, timing, and sample sizes across the two strands.</li><li><b>Use a joint display</b> to develop an integrated explanation and state its limits.</li><li><b>Report and appraise</b> the design, integration, and evidence supporting a study’s conclusions.</li></ul>",
    "bodyzh": "<p class=\"lead\">完成本課後，你將能夠：</p><ul><li><b>定位混合方法</b>在整體方法版圖中的位置，並解釋研究問題為何需要兩類證據。</li><li><b>選擇並繪製</b>聚合式、解釋型循序或探索型循序設計。</li><li><b>論證抽樣</b>選擇、兩部分的樣本關係、時序及樣本大小。</li><li><b>運用聯合展示</b>形成整合解釋，並說明其界限。</li><li><b>報告並評析</b>研究設計、整合方式，以及支持研究結論的證據。</li></ul>",
